{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's New Year's Eve 1997 and, like every year, Lani, Collin &amp; Tiho are playing a video game that is on an unlabeled cartridge. But this year something strange happens and they are taken into a twisted fantasy world. The cartridge seems to contain not only the addictive game, but also a dark secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/extras/YouTube_Devlog_img.png?t=1744190565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 playable main characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> classic point and click gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> story based, funny, full of fantasy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> hand drawn and hand animated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> solo developed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/extras/Discord_Hinweis.png?t=1744190565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey guys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm Christoph - the developer of &quot;A Pretty Broken Adventure&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After my debut game &quot;Cleo - a pirate's tale&quot; this is my second point and click adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The development is still in the early stages, but I am very happy to finally announce this new project to you. I would like to share the journey with you and that's why I publish a detailed devlog video at the first of every month. So let's start the journey to A PRETTY BROKEN ADVENTURE together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2288530?t=1744190565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744190565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744190565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744190565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's New Year's Eve 1997 and, like every year, Lani, Collin &amp; Tiho are playing a video game that is on an unlabeled cartridge. But this year something strange happens and they are taken into a twisted fantasy world. The cartridge seems to contain not only the addictive game, but also a dark secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/extras/YouTube_Devlog_img.png?t=1744190565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 playable main characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> classic point and click gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> story based, funny, full of fantasy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> hand drawn and hand animated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> solo developed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/extras/Discord_Hinweis.png?t=1744190565\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey guys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm Christoph - the developer of &quot;A Pretty Broken Adventure&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After my debut game &quot;Cleo - a pirate's tale&quot; this is my second point and click adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The development is still in the early stages, but I am very happy to finally announce this new project to you. I would like to share the journey with you and that's why I publish a detailed devlog video at the first of every month. So let's start the journey to A PRETTY BROKEN ADVENTURE together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Christoph Schultz"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288530/header.jpg?t=1744190565","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.11 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD FX or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 460 Series / AMD 75XX or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256943311,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256943311/movie480.mp4?t=1682956357","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256943311/movie_max.mp4?t=1682956357"},"name":"Announcement Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256943311/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1682956357","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256943311/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1682956357","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256943311/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1682956357"}}],"name":"A Pretty Broken Adventure","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requ